    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Flexible <span class="search-hit mathjax">Language</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Modeling</span> in Continuous Space with <span class="search-hit mathjax">Transformer</span>-based Autoregressive Flows
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+R">Ruixiang Zhang</a>, 
      
