        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.00417">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2507.00417">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2507.00417">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
