      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.00380">arXiv:2507.00380</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.00380">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2507.00380">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2507.00380">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
